OL,3,GNEWSAPay deal struck to end airport
OL,4,Aindustrial action
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndustrial action at Norwich Airport
OL,7,Fhas ended after air traffic control
OL,8,Fstaff voted to accept a pay offer.
OL,10,FThe airport said it was informed by the
OL,11,Funion, Prospect, that its members had
OL,12,Fvoted to accept the latest offer.
OL,14,FA spokesperson for Norwich Airport
OL,15,Fsaid: "The airport welcomes the outcome
OL,16,Fand is pleased an agreement has been
OL,17,Freached following constructive
OL,18,Fdiscussions with the union."
OL,20,FProspect has been approached for
OL,21,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
